;; Outbound networking denied except to this machine — for a live check that
;; needs a local model (Ollama on localhost) or the app's webview reaching its
;; daemon on 127.0.0.1, and nothing else. Use it from the daemon's FIRST launch:
;; `web_fetch` raises no approval prompt and the shipped research agent has web
;; access, so an unsandboxed daemon reaches the internet whenever a model
;; delegates research (it happened in a live check on 2026-10-03).
;; Usage (macOS; sandbox-exec is deprecated but functional):
;;   sandbox-exec -f scripts/eval/memory/loopback-only.sb openalpacad
;; Prove it before the first model turn: a request to localhost succeeds and a
;; request to a public host fails. `no-network.sb` beside this file is the
;; stricter profile, which also refuses localhost.
(version 1)
(allow default)
(deny network-outbound)
(allow network-outbound (remote ip "localhost:*"))
